\ Companion module for task_load_lock_cancel.1z. The inner task-scope keeps the
\ loading task suspended, and the load lock held, long enough for the entry to
\ cancel the waiting task.
\
\ The nesting is deliberate. It pins a load parking through a scope body, while
\ fixtures/task_load_lock_slow_mod.1z pins the direct park at a module's top level.

use "time" ;

[ 100 milliseconds sleep ] task-scope

hold-word: ( -- s ) [ "held" ] ;
